---
import Layout from "../Layout.astro";
import logo from "../../web/assets/logo.svg?url";
---
<Layout title="Blog · OpenLeo" description="Guides for getting more out of OpenLeo.">
<body class="frame min-h-screen text-ink">
<main class="legal mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-[760px] flex-col gap-4 bg-page px-6 py-14 shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--line)] sm:px-10">
<a href="./" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[15px] font-semibold"><img src={logo} alt="" class="size-7" />OpenLeo</a>
<h1 class="mt-6 text-[36px] leading-tight font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Blog</h1>
<p class="text-[13px] text-ink-3">Guides for getting more out of OpenLeo.</p>
<a href="./blog/tailscale" class="mt-2 flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-card border border-line p-4 hover:bg-inset">
<span class="text-[13px] text-ink-3">Guide · 9 October 2026</span>
<span class="text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink">Use OpenLeo from anywhere with Tailscale</span>
<span class="text-[14px] text-ink-2">Open your boards on your phone or laptop, wherever you are, while OpenLeo keeps running at home.</span>
</a>
<p class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-t border-dashed border-line pt-6 text-[13px] text-ink-3"><a href="./">Home</a><a href="./blog">Blog</a><a href="./changelog">Changelog</a><a href="./privacy">Privacy</a><a href="./terms">Terms</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</Layout>
